  "content": "<h3><img src=\"https://coolsimulations.net/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/infinitywaterbucket_logo_HD.png\" alt=\"无限水桶\" width=\"1024\" height=\"512\"></h3>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>无限水桶概述：</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">无限水桶是一款小型模组，允许通过铁砧对水桶附魔“无限”附魔，从而提供无限的可移动水源。它还允许您对空桶附魔“无限”附魔，从而提供一个无限的液体虚空。通过配置文件，您还可以对熔岩桶、牛奶桶和粉末雪桶（3.0.0+版本）进行附魔。</span></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>无限水桶要求：</strong></span></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">无限水桶可以在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fprojects.neoforged.net%252fneoforged%252fneoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a> 或 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252fuse%252finstaller%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a> 上运行，甚至支持 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flegacyfabric.net%252fdownloads.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">Legacy Fabric</a>。在 Fabric（包括 Legacy Fabric）上，Fabric API 是可选的。<br></span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>主要功能：</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><br></strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用 Mixin 允许将“无限”附魔应用于空桶和水桶。<br></span>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">与发射器配合使用，可以放置无限的水或拾取无限的液体</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">防止附魔后的空桶挤奶</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">防止附魔后的桶拾取鱼和蝾螈</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">允许您用无限的水源填充/消耗炼药锅</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">支持通过配置文件启用以下物品的附魔</span>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">熔岩桶</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">牛奶桶</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">粉末雪桶</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">服务器端模组，但客户端缺少时会导致视觉故障</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">内置更新检查器<br></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">模组支持（1.20+ 版本已停止支持）</span>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/infinity-water-bucket/settings/https:/www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/caves-and-cliffs-backport\" rel=\"nofollow\">Caves and Cliffs Backport</a> - 防止拾取蝾螈及填充/清空炼药锅<br></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/milk-all-the-mobs/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Milk All The Mobs (Forge</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/milk-all-the-mobs-fabric/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric)</a> - 防止附魔后的空桶对支持的实体进行挤奶</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/get-in-the-bucket-mod/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Get In The Bucket Mod</a> - 防止附魔后的桶拾取生物</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">请注意，本模组与 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/infinity-mending-unnerf\" rel=\"nofollow\">Infinity Mending Unnerf</a> 不兼容</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://coolsimulations.net/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/InfinityWaterBucketPreview.gif\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\"></strong></span></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Minecraft 版本：</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">请不要要求将无限水桶移植到旧版本的 Minecraft。coolsim 会在尽快将无限水桶更新到最新版本，所以请勿询问。<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>许可证和整合包：</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">请随意在任何整合包中使用无限水桶，但请务必注明作者 coolsim。不得以任何形式重新分发无限水桶。</span></p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
